OL,3,GNEWSAMcFly first act announced for
OL,4,ALudlow concerts
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey are due to appear at the castle on
OL,7,F25 July 2027 and the promoters,
OL,8,FFuturesound Group, said more
OL,9,Fannouncements would follow. Tickets
OL,10,Fwill go on sale to people in the Ludlow
OL,11,Farea from Wednesday, and they go on
OL,12,Fgeneral sale on Friday.
